00:07:49,090 --> 00:07:55,090
Exit Through the Gift Shop is a documentary film directed by Banksy.

3
00:11:43,636 --> 00:11:49,636
Banksy is a graffiti artist with a global reputation whose work can be seen on walls from
post-hurricane New Orleans to the separation barrier on the Palestinian West Bank.

4
00:15:38,181 --> 00:15:44,181
Fiercely guarding his anonymity to avoid prosecution, Banksy has so
far resisted all attempts to be captured on film.

5
00:19:32,727 --> 00:19:38,727
Exit Through the Gift Shop tells the incredible true story of how an eccentric French shop keeper turned documentary
maker attempted to locate and befriend Banksy, only to have the artist turn the camera back on its owner.

6
